---
description: Provider adapter and integration rules
alwaysApply: true
---
Domain models are provider independent. Talk to vendors only through Vector adapters.
Required adapter families: AIProvider, EmailProvider, SocialProvider, AnalyticsProvider, StorageProvider, SearchProvider.
Grok is the first AI implementation, not a hard-coded dependency throughout the domain.
Use official provider APIs. Do not drive production publishing through browser automation.
Encrypt provider tokens at rest. Never send them to the browser, logs, or the model.
Every adapter needs typed IO, timeout, retry, idempotency, normalized errors, health, audit, and metrics.
Webhooks verify signatures, deduplicate event IDs, ack quickly, and finish work in durable jobs.
